{"3740120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MabelDOS", "steam_appid": 3740120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulates The Look &amp; Feel Of Old Disk Operating Systems (DOS).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains Many Easter Eggs, Advancements And An Idle-Game Points System (With A TSR Program That Runs When Started With The &quot;Idle&quot; Command).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes A Full Custom File-System Format (&quot;MabelFS&quot;) That Reads From A Virtual Hard Disk Image &quot;vDisk&quot;. <br>All Save Data Also Lives On The Virtual Disk, So Deleting It Resets The Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Can Also Enable &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; With A Special Command, That Turns The Text Green, And Plays A Music Track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 13 Advancements To Unlock,  <br>2 Unique Game Modes (Idle Point System And MabelEdit Text Editor),  <br>There's Plenty Of Keyboard-Jabbing To Enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; Music Track Is A Placeholder I Made, To Avoid Copyright Issues.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulates The Look &amp; Feel Of Old Disk Operating Systems (DOS).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains Many Easter Eggs, Advancements And An Idle-Game Points System (With A TSR Program That Runs When Started With The &quot;Idle&quot; Command).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes A Full Custom File-System Format (&quot;MabelFS&quot;) That Reads From A Virtual Hard Disk Image &quot;vDisk&quot;. <br>All Save Data Also Lives On The Virtual Disk, So Deleting It Resets The Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Can Also Enable &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; With A Special Command, That Turns The Text Green, And Plays A Music Track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 13 Advancements To Unlock,  <br>2 Unique Game Modes (Idle Point System And MabelEdit Text Editor),  <br>There's Plenty Of Keyboard-Jabbing To Enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; Music Track Is A Placeholder I Made, To Avoid Copyright Issues.</p>", "short_description": "Simulates The Look &amp; Feel Of Old Disk Operating Systems (DOS). It Contains 12 Advancements, An Idle-Game Points System, And Text Editor. Includes A Full Custom File-System Format (&quot;MabelFS&quot;) That Reads From A Virtual Hard Disk Image.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740120/7b5b17cba7193612773c9cd47291acaf64875a82/header.jpg?t=1787340720", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740120/c9a8d21e0a747e154c488df6586098e534b024de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787340720", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740120/c9a8d21e0a747e154c488df6586098e534b024de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787340720", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 21H2<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7600K / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 128 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 25H2<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400F / AMD Ryzen 5 7600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</st